    "·": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "·"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "「稿子左右翻转」给外接分光提词器用。\n「前置录制镜像」关掉后,录出来的画面和别人看你时一致(画面里有文字时建议关)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“Mirror Script” is for external beam-splitter teleprompters.\nWith “Mirror Front Recording” off, the footage matches how others see you (recommended when there's text in frame)."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Medium"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "中性": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Neutral"
          }
        }
      }
    },
