      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Single"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "去设置里打开": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双摄": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双摄启动失败，已退回单摄": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual camera failed to start — switched back to single camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双摄小窗": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual-Camera PiP"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双摄硬件负载超限（%@），已退回单摄": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual camera exceeded the hardware budget (%@) — switched back to single camera"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "双摄需要同时拿到前后广角摄像头": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dual camera needs both the front and back wide cameras"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "口播相机要用摄像头录像、用麦克风收音并识别你读到哪一句。\n识别全程在本机完成,不会上传任何音频。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "CueCam records video with the camera and uses the microphone to hear which line you're on.\nRecognition runs entirely on device — no audio is ever uploaded."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只需一次,之后全程离线识别": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One-time download; recognition then runs fully offline"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回看": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Recordings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "回看录制": {
