    "小窗位置直接拖动画面上的小窗即可,会吸附到最近的角;点一下小窗前后互换。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drag the inset window to move it — it snaps to the nearest corner. Tap it to swap the front and back cameras."
          }
        }
      }
    },
